          <span class="lang-en">Three of every four layers never touch the KV cache; to the residual
            stream the two mixers are interchangeable — only their memory contracts differ.</span>
          <span class="lang-ko">4개 layer 중 3개는 KV cache를 아예 만지지 않는다; residual stream에게
