            <li><a class="arrow-link" href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2501.08313" target="_blank" rel="noopener">MiniMax-01 — lightning attention hybrid at 456B scale (arXiv 2501.08313)</a></li>
            <li><a class="arrow-link" href="/reviews/gated-deltanet/">This site's review: Gated DeltaNet</a></li>
